                                            "Synonym of puppet (“a person completely controlled by another”)"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "050f91d0-5fe3-326c-a2b9-2b230f9ef44d",
                                        "entry_id": "84bf2c03-1856-30d5-8709-bc58e141084d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An alternative pseudonymous online account, especially one used for abuse."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Internet",
                                            "derogatory"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "01b3e655-8224-475b-950a-7579ce05d829",
                                                "sense_id": "050f91d0-5fe3-326c-a2b9-2b230f9ef44d",
                                                "text": "Trying to prove that a new user is simply a previous user in a new sock puppet is quite hard for the ordinary user and even administrators."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dce07779-6a4b-4055-9f94-4bc67b587f72",
                                                "sense_id": "050f91d0-5fe3-326c-a2b9-2b230f9ef44d",
                                                "text": "The Internet has created many opportunities for online voting. Unscrupulous people will create sock puppets in order to stuff online ballot boxes. In other cases, a sock puppeteer may create multiple identities to support arguments, voice opinions, or otherwise create the online illusion that may people support the sock puppeteer. This practice is called a \"Sybil attack\" […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
